---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="關於" nav="about">
  <article>
    <h1 class="zh-only">關於我</h1>
    <p class="h1-en en">About</p>
    <figure class="portrait"><img src="/images/portrait.jpg" alt="文昇 Wensheng" width="724" height="1086" /></figure>
    <div class="prose">
      <div class="pair">
        <p class="zh">我是文昇，一名科技研發工程師，住在台灣。2026 年，我五十歲，開始寫這個部落格，記錄生活、想法與省思。</p>
        <p class="en">I'm Wensheng, a technology R&amp;D engineer living in Taiwan. In 2026, at fifty, I started this blog to record my life, thoughts, and reflections.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="artwork">
      <img src="/images/matisse-violinist.jpg" alt="馬諦斯〈窗前的小提琴手〉 / Henri Matisse, The Violinist at the Window" width="800" height="1224" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption>
        <span class="zh-only">在美術館遇見馬諦斯的〈窗前的小提琴手〉，1918。</span>
        <span class="en">Meeting Matisse's <i>The Violinist at the Window</i> (1918) at the museum.</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <a class="back" href="/">← 回到首頁 <span class="en">Back to home</span></a>
  </article>
</Base>
